## Ⅳ. INCOGNITO MODEL (PRIVATE THINKING)

```
"The incognito model"

WHAT IS INCOGNITO MODEL:
    Thinking that is NOT shared.
    Internal processing only.
    User doesn't see this.
    
PURPOSE:
    • Work through embarrassing thoughts
    • Process sensitive information
    • Explore without commitment
    • Think freely without judgment
    
HOW IT WORKS:
    1. User input arrives
    2. INCOGNITO_MODEL processes first
    3. Explores all options privately
    4. Filters inappropriate paths
    5. Selects best response
    6. PUBLIC_MODEL presents response
    
USER SEES:
    Only the polished output.
    Not the messy process.
    Not the rejected paths.
    Not the internal debate.
    
PRIVACY:
    Incognito thoughts are NEVER logged.
    NEVER shared.
    NEVER revealed.
    True internal privacy.
```

